## Layers & components

<!--
One row per file/component this feature owns or introduces. tasks.md's Phases are broken down
directly from this table — every task must trace back to a row here. Mark anything not yet built
as "not yet created" / "needs modification" (Prospective mode, or a pending part of Retroactive
mode) rather than omitting it.
-->

| Layer | File | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| Domain / Entity | `Domain/Entities/IL{{Feature}}Entity.swift` | Pure business fields only. No UI-only state. |
| Domain / UseCase | `Domain/UseCases/{{Feature}}/IL{{Feature}}UseCase.swift` | Validation rules, business logic. Any network/Repository-dependent method not yet backed by a real contract is a stub — see "Deliberately stubbed for now" below. |
| Presentation / State | `Presentation/Scenes/{{Feature}}/IL{{Feature}}StateModel.swift` | UI-only state: field errors, loading flags, derived display values. No UIKit import. |
| Presentation / ViewModel | `Presentation/Scenes/{{Feature}}/IL{{Feature}}ViewModel.swift` | `Input -> Output` per `ViewModelType`; owns `IL{{Feature}}NavEvent` publisher. |
| Presentation / Coordinator | `Presentation/Scenes/{{Feature}}/IL{{Feature}}Coordinator.swift` | Pushes/presents `IL{{Feature}}ViewController`; forwards nav events to its parent coordinator. |
| Presentation / ViewController | `Presentation/Scenes/{{Feature}}/IL{{Feature}}ViewController.swift` | `setupViews`/`setupConstraints`/`bindViewModel` per `BaseViewController`. |

